                        <dir xml:id="h110d8wu" place="above" staff="1" tstamp="1">The "Chorus" melody is shown here in a very "straight" format. It should be played, however, in the hot style of Bix's 1927 recording. Cornetists should embellish the lead part in this manner.</dir>
